# Firdoch Core is a Kindred Artifact - Shapeshifter with Changeling (CR 702.73a): every creature type, so it is a Pirate,
# an Assassin and the rest of Shoot the Sheriff's outlaws (CR 700.12) once "{4}: This artifact becomes a 4/4 artifact
# creature until end of turn" makes it a creature. It keeps the types it has (Kindred, Artifact) and gains Creature
# (CR 205.1b); the 4/4 is its base power and toughness. Bot2's Shoot the Sheriff is refused against the animated Core
# and allowed against Ornithopter, a creature with no outlaw type (the positive control). Before the Core is animated
# it is not a creature, so no creature spell may target it either way. Bot1 casts Sol Ring with Mox Jet on turn 1 and
# the Core with Sol Ring and Mox Ruby; on turn 3 the animation costs Sol Ring's {C}{C} and two more.

